Process Details

DL PC Monitoring

Continuously scans production CSV logs and monitors failure counts in the active production window.

Sends a STOP request to the Main PC when the configured failure threshold is exceeded.


FT PC Monitoring

Combines data from all FT stations and calculates active failures with Last-60 statistics.

Detects abnormal conditions and transmits STOP requests to the Main PC.


Main PC Automation

Validates machine readiness by checking Building/Function occupancy before automation.

Executes the automated STOP → SETUP → START sequence and updates system status.


Dashboard & Reporting

Displays real-time machine status, failure statistics, and blocked conditions.

Provides centralized monitoring for operators while running continuously in the background.


